$ nage health --help
[stdout]
Ask the server on this machine whether it is healthy; exit 0 only when it is

Usage: nage health [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --bind <ADDR>  The address the server listens on; 0.0.0.0 is asked as 127.0.0.1 and :: as ::1 [env: NAGE_BIND] [default: 127.0.0.1:8787]
  -h, --help         Print help
[stderr]
